Error [jet.UnknownMethod]: `decorate` isn't a method on this value
  --> run.jet:7:21
    |
  7 |     print(text.wrap.decorate("hi"))
    |                     ^^^^^^^^
 Why: `text.wrap` is a function, and a function has no methods
 Fix: Call `text.wrap(…)` itself, or call an item that `text` publishes
